    "title": "David Muir issues a warning about a deadly threat - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alexander Clark ,\n8 hours ago David Muir has built his reputation on a calm delivery that rarely oversells a story, which is precisely why his recent on-air alerts about deadly risks have carried such weight. When he raises his voice to call something a catastrophe in the making or a dangerous and deadly situation, he is signaling that viewers are not just watching the news, they are living inside it. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
